      "id": "RecruitBarkeep",
      "text": "I know a sellsword who comes through sometimes. Name's Kira. She's... intense.",
      "speaker": "Barkeep",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "KiraIntro",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "KiraLocation",
      "text": "She's in the back room. Blue cloak, two swords. Can't miss her.",
      "speaker": "Barkeep",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "KiraRate",
      "text": "She negotiates. Bring coin and patience.",
      "speaker": "Barkeep",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "KiraWarning",
      "text": "She's never failed a contract. But she's got... rules. Strange ones. Don't break them.",
      "speaker": "Barkeep",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "KiraMeet",
      "text": "You find Kira sharpening her blade in the dim light.",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "KiraApproach",
      "text": "State your business. I don't do small talk.",
      "speaker": "Kira",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "KiraOffer",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "KiraJob",
      "text": "Mountain? Which one?",
      "speaker": "Kira",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "KiraWhich",
      "text": "Mount Sorrow?",
      "speaker": "Kira",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "KiraSorrow",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "KiraKnows",
      "text": "Everyone's heard of it. Not everyone's stupid enough to go.",
      "speaker": "Kira",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "KiraConcern",
      "text": "Problem? It's suicide. But the pay would need to match.",
      "speaker": "Kira",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "KiraPrice",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "KiraNaming",
      "text": "200 gold. Half now, half when we're done. If we survive, you owe me a story.",
      "speaker": "Kira",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "KiraDeal",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "KiraJoins",
      "text": "Then we leave at dawn. Don't be late. I won't wait.",
      "speaker": "Kira",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "KiraHaggle",
      "text": "175. And you carry the supplies.",
      "speaker": "Kira",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "KiraHaggleFinal",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "KiraGlory",
      "text": "Glory doesn't pay for food. But... the Crimson Blade is legendary. 150 gold.",
      "speaker": "Kira",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "KiraFlattery",
      "text": "Flattery is cheap. What do you want?",
      "speaker": "Kira",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "KiraDirect",
      "text": "Depends on the threat. Mount Sorrow? That's 200 gold minimum.",
      "speaker": "Kira",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "KiraDecision",
      "text": "If you're going to Sorrow, you'll need me. 200 gold. Take it or leave it.",
      "speaker": "Kira",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "PartyFormed",
      "text": "With Kira at your side, the odds feel slightly less suicidal.",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "MerchantApproach",
      "text": "Ah, a customer perhaps? Or just looking for company?",
      "speaker": "Merchant",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "MerchantGreet",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "MerchantTrouble",
      "text": "It's nothing. Just... debts. Powerful people. You know how it is.",
      "speaker": "Merchant",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "MerchantDebt",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "MerchantAmount",
      "text": "500 gold. By month's end, or...",
      "speaker": "Merchant",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "MerchantThreat",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "MerchantHelp",
      "text": "What kind of price?",
      "speaker": "Merchant",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "MerchantBargain",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "MerchantDeal",
      "text": "Everything? I... alright. Save me and it's yours.",
      "speaker": "Merchant",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "MerchantInfoDeal",
      "text": "Information? I know expeditions. Gear lists. Who came back. It's yours if you help.",
      "speaker": "Merchant",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "MerchantPartner",
      "text": "A partner? That's... actually fair. You help with this, and we split future profits. Deal?",
      "speaker": "Merchant",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "MerchantAllied",
      "text": "You've gained a potential ally\u2014or liability. Time will tell.",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "MerchantHit",
      "text": "You're... offering to kill them? That's dark. But effective. 100 gold if you do.",
      "speaker": "Merchant",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "HitChoice",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "HitAccepted",
      "text": "You've accepted a contract to kill. This will have consequences.",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "HitNegotiate",
      "text": "150. That's all I have left.",
      "speaker": "Merchant",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "HitFinal",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "MerchantCreditor",
      "text": "A guild. The Black Ledger. They don't forgive debts.",
      "speaker": "Merchant",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "MerchantSuspicious",
      "text": "It's just gold! Honestly earned! Why would you\u2014are you with THEM?!",
      "speaker": "Merchant",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "MerchantPanic",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "MerchantTerror",
      "text": "Please! I can pay! I just need more time!",
      "speaker": "Merchant",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "MerchantBeg",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "MerchantRelief",
      "text": "Oh thank the gods. You nearly gave me a heart attack. Drinks on me.",
      "speaker": "Merchant",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "MerchantBribed",
      "text": "Anything! Ask and it's yours!",
      "speaker": "Merchant",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "MerchantFate",
      "text": "The merchant's scream is cut short. The tavern falls silent.",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "MerchantFriendly",
      "text": "You're alright, friend. Let me know if you need gear or trade contacts.",
      "speaker": "Merchant",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "BarkeepApproach",
      "text": "What'll it be? Ale, wine, or something stronger?",
      "speaker": "Barkeep",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "DrinkChoice",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "DrinkAle",
      "text": "Classic choice. 2 copper.",
      "speaker": "Barkeep",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "DrinkWine",
      "text": "From the southern vineyards. 5 copper.",
      "speaker": "Barkeep",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "DrinkStrong",
      "text": "Dwarven Fire. You sure? It's knocked out knights.",
      "speaker": "Barkeep",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "StrongConfirm",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "DrinkDouble",
      "text": "Your funeral.",
      "speaker": "Barkeep",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "DrinkPassed",
      "text": "The world spins. Then goes dark. You wake up in an alley, missing 50 gold.",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "RobbedWake",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "AlleyRage",
      "text": "Your shout echoes. A rat scurries away. No answers come.",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "AlleyCheck",
      "text": "Your pack is intact. The map is still there. But your coin pouch is lighter.",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "AlleyCalm",
      "text": "You take stock. Gold gone, but otherwise unharmed. Could be worse.",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "TavernReturn",
      "text": "You stumble back to the tavern. The barkeep smirks.",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "BarkeepSmirk",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "BarkeepAccuse",
      "text": "I told you Dwarven Fire knocks out knights. Not my fault you didn't listen.",
      "speaker": "Barkeep",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "BarkeepLaugh",
      "text": "Ha! You've got spirit. This one's on the house.",
      "speaker": "Barkeep",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "DrinkServed",
      "text": "The drink warms your belly. The world feels slightly better.",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "BarkeepBribe",
      "text": "Information costs. 20 gold and I'll tell you what I know about the castle nearby.",
      "speaker": "Barkeep",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "StrangerHostile",
      "text": "You've made a dangerous enemy today.",
      "speaker": "Stranger",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "StrangerChoice",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "StrangerFight",
      "text": "Blades flash. The stranger is fast\u2014too fast.",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "StrangerBattle",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "StrangerWound",
      "text": "You land a cut, but so does she. Blood drips from both of you.",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "StrangerStalemate",
      "text": "Enough. You fight well. Perhaps we started poorly.",
      "speaker": "Stranger",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "StrangerTruce",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "StrangerExplain",
      "text": "I test potential allies. You passed.",
      "speaker": "Stranger",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "StrangerMercy",
      "text": "Coward. But at least you're smart. Leave my sight.",
      "speaker": "Stranger",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "StrangerCalm",
      "text": "Words are wind. But I'll give you one chance. Explain yourself.",
      "speaker": "Stranger",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "StrangerExplain2",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "StrangerNote",
      "text": "The note is none of your concern. But since you're bold...",
      "speaker": "Stranger",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "StrangerLie",
      "text": "[Narrows eyes] You're lying. But I appreciate the attempt.",
      "speaker": "Stranger",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "StrangerReveal",
      "text": "Perceptive. I was once known as the Shadow of Eloria. Now I am no one.",
      "speaker": "Stranger",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "StrangerIdentity",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "StrangerFamous",
      "text": "Former. Retired. Mostly.",
      "speaker": "Stranger",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "StrangerPurpose",
      "text": "Waiting. For someone like you, perhaps.",
      "speaker": "Stranger",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "StrangerOffended",
      "text": "Good. That means I did my job well.",
      "speaker": "Stranger",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "WorkOffer",
      "text": "Work? I have a task. Dangerous. Well-paid. Interested?",
      "speaker": "Stranger",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "WorkChoice",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "WorkDetails",
      "text": "Retrieve an item from the old crypt. A ring. Don't ask what it does.",
      "speaker": "Stranger",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "WorkRisk",
      "text": "Undead. Traps. The usual.",
      "speaker": "Stranger",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "WorkPay",
      "text": "100 gold on completion. More if you're fast.",
      "speaker": "Stranger",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "WorkAccept",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "SideQuestAccepted",
      "text": "Good. Come back when it's done. Don't die.",
      "speaker": "Stranger",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "BarFight",
      "text": "Tables overturn! The tavern erupts into chaos!",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "BarFightChoice",
      "text": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    {
      "id": "BarFightWin",
      "text": "Fists fly. You emerge victorious, bruised but alive.",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "BarFightHide",
      "text": "Chaos swirls above as you wait it out. Eventually, calm returns.",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "BarFightAfter",
      "text": "OUT! All of you! I'm closing early!",
      "speaker": "Barkeep",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "TavernExit",
      "text": "The cool night air greets you. The adventure continues... elsewhere.",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "type": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "JourneyBegin",
      "text": "The mountain looms in the distance. Your destiny awaits.",
      "speaker": "Narrator",
      "type": "line"
    }
